! hub — DMVPN Phase 2 hub router  (Arista EOS)
!
! Fully configured: mGRE Tunnel0, NHRP server, OSPF broadcast (DR), ip nhrp redirect.
!
! Phase 2 key: OSPF broadcast mode so all routers elect a DR and LSAs carry
! the originating router's tunnel IP as the next-hop.  Hub is DR (priority 10)
! so it controls LSA flooding and adjacency formation.  When spoke1 sends
! traffic destined for spoke2 via the hub, the hub sends an NHRP redirect to
! spoke1 telling it to resolve spoke2's NBMA IP directly.
!
hostname hub
!
interface Loopback0
   ip address 10.0.0.1/32
!
interface Ethernet1
   description WAN NBMA network (10.0.0.0/24)
   no switchport
   ip address 10.0.0.1/24
   no shutdown
!
interface Tunnel0
   description DMVPN mGRE — hub endpoint
   tunnel source Ethernet1
   tunnel mode gre multipoint
   ip address 172.16.0.1/24
   ip nhrp network-id 1
   ip nhrp holdtime 300
   ip nhrp redirect
   ip ospf network broadcast
   ip ospf priority 10
   ip ospf area 0
   no shutdown
!
ip routing
!
router ospf 1
   router-id 10.0.0.1
   passive-interface Loopback0
!
end
